WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:13.442
[MUSIC]

2
00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:17.737
A covered call would be considered
by someone who would like to derive

3
00:00:17.737 --> 00:00:20.709
additional income from
a long stock position.

4
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:23.921
A covered call allows
the investor to hold a long

5
00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:28.422
equity position while simultaneously
receiving the premium from

6
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:31.969
selling an equal amount of
call options against it.

7
00:00:31.969 --> 00:00:36.910
The covered call writer is bullish
on the stock's long term potential,

8
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:41.932
but is willing to forego a stock's
upside above the strike during the life

9
00:00:41.932 --> 00:00:46.473
of the option in order to receive
the proceeds of the core premium.

10
00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:52.271
The covered call writer benefits from time
decay from a reduction in volatility,

11
00:00:52.271 --> 00:00:56.567
and if the stock increases its
dividend before expiration.

12
00:00:56.567 --> 00:01:01.381
It should be noted that the combined
position has a similar profile to

13
00:01:01.381 --> 00:01:02.797
that of a short put.

14
00:01:02.797 --> 00:01:07.842
The covered call writer remains exposed
to any downside in the underlying shares,

15
00:01:07.842 --> 00:01:10.590
meaning his loss potential is substantial.

16
00:01:13.211 --> 00:01:16.638
[MUSIC]